      'rk.pushFailed': 'Made, but not sent to the shared file yet \u2014 press Sync now before you hand them out.',
      'rk.noKeys': 'That code was made before this club had role passwords, so there is nothing to check the word against. Ask your coach for the current team code.',
      'rk.noCrypto': 'This browser cannot make passwords. Open the app over https and try again.',
