      'rk.forSquadCoach': 'a full coach, kept to that squad',
      'rk.forClubAdmin': 'everything a coach can do, plus people and access',
      'rk.forSuperAdmin': 'the whole app, including wiping data',
      'rk.teamNote': 'Each squad has two words of its own: one for its coaches and one for its players. Whoever joins with either sees that squad and no other \u2014 the rest are not on their screen or in their team picker. Hand out the club-wide Coach word instead and that person works with every squad. Add a squad and it gets its own pair the next time you open this screen; the ones already handed out keep working.',
      'rk.field': 'Password from your coach',
      'rk.fieldHint': 'Without one this copy opens read-only \u2014 you can read everything the coach shares and change nothing.',
      'rk.unlock': 'Unlock',
      'rk.unlockHint': 'Given the word after you joined? Type it here and this copy becomes what it opens.',
